{"runs":[{"tool":{"driver":{"name":"mobsfscan","rules":[{"id":"webview_set_allow_file_access","help":{"text":"WebView File System Access is enabled. An attacker able to inject script into a WebView, could exploit the opportunity to access local resources.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05h-Testing-Platform-Interaction.md/#testing-webview-protocol-handlers-mstg-platform-6"},"name":"WebView File System Access is enabled (CWE-73)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-73","owasp-mobile/m7","masvs/platform-6"],"precision":"high","security-severity":"5.5","problem.severity":"warning"},"defaultConfiguration":{},"fullDescription":{"text":"WebView File System Access is enabled. An attacker able to inject script into a WebView, could exploit the opportunity to access local resources."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05h-Testing-Platform-Interaction.md/#testing-webview-protocol-handlers-mstg-platform-6","shortDescription":{"text":"WebView File System Access is enabled (CWE-73)"}},{"id":"hardcoded_password","help":{"text":"A hardcoded password in plain text is identified.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05d-Testing-Data-Storage.md#storing-a-key---example"},"name":"A hardcoded password in plain text is identified (CWE-798)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-798","owasp-mobile/m9","masvs/storage-14"],"precision":"high","security-severity":"5.5","problem.severity":"warning"},"defaultConfiguration":{},"fullDescription":{"text":"A hardcoded password in plain text is identified."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05d-Testing-Data-Storage.md#storing-a-key---example","shortDescription":{"text":"A hardcoded password in plain text is identified (CWE-798)"}},{"id":"aes_ecb_mode","help":{"text":"The App uses ECB mode in Cryptographic encryption algorithm. ECB mode is known to be weak as it results in the same ciphertext for identical blocks of plaintext.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x04g-Testing-Cryptography.md#weak-block-cipher-mode"},"name":"The App uses ECB mode in Cryptographic encryption algorithm (CWE-327)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-327","owasp-mobile/m5","masvs/crypto-2"],"precision":"high","security-severity":"9.0","problem.severity":"error"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The App uses ECB mode in Cryptographic encryption algorithm. ECB mode is known to be weak as it results in the same ciphertext for identical blocks of plaintext."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x04g-Testing-Cryptography.md#weak-block-cipher-mode","shortDescription":{"text":"The App uses ECB mode in Cryptographic encryption algorithm (CWE-327)"}},{"id":"js_dynamic_code_execution","help":{"text":"Dynamic JavaScript code execution via eval(), new Function(), or setTimeout/setInterval with a string argument was detected. Executing dynamically constructed strings can lead to arbitrary code execution inside the application context.\n\nReference: https://mobile-security.gitbook.io/mobile-security-testing-guide/"},"name":"Dynamic JavaScript code execution via eval(), new Function(), or setTimeout/setInterval with a string argument was detected (CWE-95)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-95","owasp-mobile/m7","masvs/code-4"],"precision":"high","security-severity":"7.5","problem.severity":"warning"},"defaultConfiguration":{},"fullDescription":{"text":"Dynamic JavaScript code execution via eval(), new Function(), or setTimeout/setInterval with a string argument was detected. Executing dynamically constructed strings can lead to arbitrary code execution inside the application context."},"helpUri":"https://mobile-security.gitbook.io/mobile-security-testing-guide/","shortDescription":{"text":"Dynamic JavaScript code execution via eval(), new Function(), or setTimeout/setInterval with a string argument was detected (CWE-95)"}},{"id":"android_certificate_transparency","help":{"text":"This app does not enforce TLS Certificate Transparency that helps to detect SSL certificates that have been mistakenly issued by a certificate authority or maliciously acquired from an otherwise unimpeachable certificate authority.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05g-Testing-Network-Communication.md#testing-custom-certificate-stores-and-certificate-pinning-mstg-network-4"},"name":"This app does not enforce TLS Certificate Transparency that helps to detect SSL certificates that have been mistakenly issued by a certificate authority or maliciously acquired from an otherwise unimpeachable certificate authority (CWE-295)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-295","owasp-mobile/m3","masvs/network-4"],"precision":"medium","security-severity":"2.0","problem.severity":"note"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"This app does not enforce TLS Certificate Transparency that helps to detect SSL certificates that have been mistakenly issued by a certificate authority or maliciously acquired from an otherwise unimpeachable certificate authority."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05g-Testing-Network-Communication.md#testing-custom-certificate-stores-and-certificate-pinning-mstg-network-4","shortDescription":{"text":"This app does not enforce TLS Certificate Transparency that helps to detect SSL certificates that have been mistakenly issued by a certificate authority or maliciously acquired from an otherwise unimpeachable certificate authority (CWE-295)"}},{"id":"android_prevent_screenshot","help":{"text":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent against Screenshots from Recent Task History/ Now On Tap etc.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05d-Testing-Data-Storage.md#finding-sensitive-information-in-auto-generated-screenshots-mstg-storage-9"},"name":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent against Screenshots from Recent Task History/ Now On Tap etc (CWE-200)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-200","owasp-mobile/m2","masvs/storage-9"],"precision":"medium","security-severity":"2.0","problem.severity":"note"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent against Screenshots from Recent Task History/ Now On Tap etc."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05d-Testing-Data-Storage.md#finding-sensitive-information-in-auto-generated-screenshots-mstg-storage-9","shortDescription":{"text":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent against Screenshots from Recent Task History/ Now On Tap etc (CWE-200)"}},{"id":"android_detect_tapjacking","help":{"text":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent tapjacking attacks. An attacker can hijack the user's taps and tricks him into performing some critical operations that he did not intend to.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05h-Testing-Platform-Interaction.md#testing-for-overlay-attacks-mstg-platform-9"},"name":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent tapjacking attacks (CWE-200)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-200","owasp-mobile/m1","masvs/platform-9"],"precision":"medium","security-severity":"2.0","problem.severity":"note"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent tapjacking attacks. An attacker can hijack the user's taps and tricks him into performing some critical operations that he did not intend to."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05h-Testing-Platform-Interaction.md#testing-for-overlay-attacks-mstg-platform-9","shortDescription":{"text":"This app does not have capabilities to prevent tapjacking attacks (CWE-200)"}},{"id":"android_root_detection","help":{"text":"This app does not have root detection capabilities. Running a sensitive application on a rooted device questions the device integrity and affects users data.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05j-Testing-Resiliency-Against-Reverse-Engineering.md#testing-root-detection-mstg-resilience-1"},"name":"This app does not have root detection capabilities (CWE-919)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-919","owasp-mobile/m8","masvs/resilience-1"],"precision":"medium","security-severity":"2.0","problem.severity":"note"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"This app does not have root detection capabilities. Running a sensitive application on a rooted device questions the device integrity and affects users data."},"helpUri":"https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05j-Testing-Resiliency-Against-Reverse-Engineering.md#testing-root-detection-mstg-resilience-1","shortDescription":{"text":"This app does not have root detection capabilities (CWE-919)"}},{"id":"android_certificate_pinning","help":{"text":"This app does not use a TLS/SSL certificate or public key pinning in code to detect or prevent MITM attacks in secure communication channel. Please verify if pinning is enabled in `network_security_config.xml`.\n\nReference: https://github.com/MobSF/owasp-mstg/blob/master/Document/0x05g-Testing-Network-Communication.md#testing-custom-certificate-stores-and-certificate-pinning-mstg-network-4"},"name":"This app does not use a TLS/SSL certificate or public key pinning in code to detect or prevent MITM attacks in secure communication channel (CWE-295)","properties":{"tags":["security","external/cwe/cwe-295","owasp-mobile/m3","masvs/network-4"],"precision":"medium","security-severity":"2.0","problem.severity":"note"},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"This app does not use a TLS/SSL c